heir Power Stat trickles down to nothing, they return to death-sleep until woken up again. The only way to permanently kill one of the Arisen is to kill them at Power Stat 1, completely destroy their body, also destroy their four sacred organs (usually hidden away), and even then they can be brought back into a new body if cultists are willing to sacrifice someone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T02:34:29-07:00","id":1123373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1123329-hardist-to-kill-character-i-can-make?p=1123340#post1123340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can hit the little &amp;quot;Quote&amp;quot; button and then the person you're replying to will be notified.<br /> <br /> The Arisen are definitely harder to kill than anything from the Immortals. I don't know what the &amp;quot;doubly soulsy&amp;quot; is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Eternals are immortal unless their special object is found (they just keep regenerating). In combat, they aren't as hard, but long term they can outlast even Arisen.<br /> <br /> Doubly Soul'd are the Soul-Taker Micro-Template Amec